yed at an average of around  30 to 40 FPS higher so from all of those  tests not only does the 5600 M  completely destroy the e GPU with either  the 13 inch or 16 inch MacBook Pro and  Final Cut Pro video editing but it's  also much better at gaming with higher  fps and more consistent FPS as well  now the 5600 M is definitely more  expensive but this shows us that it's  definitely worth the investment and it's  a much better choice compared to getting  an HP u for both productivity work and  if you want to do some gaming on the  side so I think it's great that you no  longer have to buy a macbook pro for  productivity work and then buy a  separate gaming pc or gaming laptop if  you want to do some gaming just by the  150 600m macbook pro and it does  everything you need and no matter  whether you choose to go with an e GPU  or the 5600 M MacBook Pro we'll have  links to the best deals on all of these  Mac books and they each of you parts  down in the description below so  hopefully this video helped you out and  if it did go ahead and click the  subscribe button above for our WWDC  coverage on Monday and if you like this  t-shirt go ahead and check it out in the  description below or the merch shelf and  definitely go and watch those two videos  that I mentioned earlier in this one  thanks for watching and we'll see you in  the next video  [Music]
 

